:Namespace Pieces
    ⍝ Encoding of pieces as integers, used as bitboard row indices.
    ⍝ The order within a colour can be changed. Move generation relies on
    ⍝ the white pieces being 1 to 6; black pieces follow as white plus 6.

    ⎕IO ⎕ML ←1

    (P N B R Q K)←⍳6             ⍝ White pieces
    (p n b r q k)←6+P N B R Q K  ⍝ Black pieces

:EndNamespace